The project TACTIK got funded in an international collaboration between Germany and France (ANR-DfG), coordinated by my group, together with the groups of Lou Barreau (U. Paris Saclay), Peter Saalfrank (U. Potsdam) and Markus Gühr (DESY), combining X-ray and XUV photoelectron spectroscopies with quantum dynamics to decipher ultrafast intersystem crossing mechanims on aromatic ketones. 
